# 文本文件统一用 LF；Windows 的 .cmd 脚本必须用 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：不转换换行、不做文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.zip binary

# 拨云（Boyun）设计系统的导出文件，不在这里改。
# -text：按导出的字节原样存（换行不转换，map3d/BUILD.json 里的哈希对得上）；linguist-generated：GitHub 的 Files changed 默认折叠
site/assets/boyun/** -text linguist-generated=true
